 "id": "e2-p-batch",
 "description": "Synthetic pilot-line batch run R (invented names) with steps s1-s8 as occurrences. Membership is part-of(part, whole=R) from each step's start, until superseded; each step's times come from an account with a describes link to the step. Curing (s2) has sub-steps s2a-s2c. The auditor accepts every system step and denies that Inspection (s3) and Vent check (s2c) are part of their wholes; the system accepts both denials. A contractor claims a Sampling step (s8, rejected by the system) and denies Packing (s4) (unreviewed). A temporary crew lead states Labelling (s5), accepted by the auditor only. Release (s6) is instantaneous and recorded after mark m2. Variant world v (plan) branches at T10h16 with knowledge at m2 and stipulates a Rework step (s7) as part of R from T10h12. All account role sets differ, so every account is its own event description.",
